  "notes": "{越|こ}す means to cross over, move past, or exceed something.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\nCan be both transitive and intransitive depending on usage.\n\nTHREE MAIN MEANINGS:\n1. To cross/pass over: ⟦{山|やま}→山：02168_yama⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{越|こ}す (cross a mountain)\n2. To move residence: ⟦{新|あたら}しい→新しい：00506_atarashii⟧⟦{家|いえ}→家：00612_ie⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{越|こ}す\n3. To exceed: ⟦{予算|よさん}→予算：03663_yosan⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{越|こ}す (exceed the budget)\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- ⟦{引|ひ}っ{越|こ}す→引っ越す：01171_hikkosu⟧: to move (residence)\n- ⟦{乗|の}り{越|こ}す→乗り越す：21606_norikosu⟧: to ride past one's stop\n- ⟦{追|お}い{越|こ}す→追い越す：04623_oikosu⟧: to overtake, pass by\n- ⟦{年|とし}→年：00486_toshi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{越|こ}す: to see the New Year in\n\nCONTRAST WITH ⟦{超|こ}える→超える：01942_koeru⟧:\nBoth mean \"to exceed,\" but {越|こ}す emphasizes physical crossing while ⟦{超|こ}える→超える：01942_koeru⟧ emphasizes surpassing limits.",
